<title>Southern Thailand: the situation</title>
<link>https://map.igred.org/crisis/thailand/</link>
<guid isPermaLink="false">igred-summary-thailand-2026-11-07T15:48:04.951Z</guid>
<pubDate>Sat, 07 Nov 2026 15:48:04 GMT</pubDate>
<description>&lt;p&gt;Thai forces have expanded border patrols, fired warning shots and dug trenches after Myanmar bombs damaged a health centre and artillery struck villages in Tak and Mae Sot, while the Myanmar ambassador attended a Kathina robes offering ceremony organized by the Thai armed forces. Cambodia has moved troops to its border with Thailand, dug trenches and urged fast demarcation, also facilitating an observation mission along the Cambodia-Thailand border. China and Thailand are launching a cross-border e-CNY payment connection and the Malaysia-Thailand East Coast Rail Link is nearing the Thai border. The Royal Thai Air Force is modernising its network and the KNU says relations with Thailand remain unchanged despite Myanmar junta warnings. 35 battle-related deaths were recorded in 2024, according to UCDP.&lt;/p&gt;&lt;p&gt;&lt;em&gt;Machine-written from the linked sources, checked for figures and names not in them.&lt;/em&gt;&lt;/p&gt;&lt;p&gt;&lt;a href=&quot;https://news.google.com/rss/articles/CBMiwAFBVV95cUxOb0dDLUNfSm5xTDBrSm9KZUIzcHZabUQ1X0FPQ1FiazBROHNYTlRJZjUzR2hxaS1MeDNoYnBLaHJpZ080bEZLeUR1RV9CQW03MkZTM1lqUjVtWk9ieXJmNGtQVlZIRUxFc01YNmlVTkhrNGptV1E4TGd6TGxOS3FncFZwa0FmWUlGS1Z1X0lGNlRHWlJ0N1hOVTFndlZFMV9mbVFpQy1kb0RZSk1TZFNXbjNCWTdiMkNIdjJ4NGRMbjQ?oc=5&quot;&gt;The Star&lt;/a&gt;, &lt;a href=&quot;https://news.google.com/rss/articles/CBMiYEFVX3lxTE5lWkw4aFJ5RVBfM2VfRThqOU1wOGZJM1l2SHYxN0ZNOWJ3WE1tTEtPRmhPc3hqeUh5WjZnV055Z1lEOF9EZDc0NEcxTzRiSHJsNldKUENZT2ZZaEZOZHNtUw?oc=5&quot;&gt;Thai PBS World&lt;/a&gt;, &lt;a href=&quot;https://news.google.com/rss/articles/CBMiX0FVX3lxTE9qc2dlMVIzNEZNSmg3dVlUN2RTNFg1X0JUbWw1UFI5ZXV2U090VC1xaEVDaEF1dHVGbjM2WUlkRU1ObDFEQ1ZPT2dDQ2tGeDN4eWd6Y3UxbmctX1c0R3g4?oc=5&quot;&gt;Nation Thailand&lt;/a&gt;, &lt;a href=&quot;https://news.google.com/rss/articles/CBMiYkFVX3lxTE1ZQk00QVJwSk5XOFFMYWdrY3pNVkRTRzFWYzN2elR6cTRNNXFWd2otUGFLR0NTS05mVWkzN3o0M3ZNcktVdnZ0SGpjYWhtb1dFN3oxSGZUVUxrVjlwYUVEMk9B?oc=5&quot;&gt;Nation Thail